Z||000000||NOS3800||07-23-2001||06:56 PM||||WHo will win a race between a Supercharged 3800 with smaller pulley, reprogrammed computer and adjustable FPR up against NOS injected normally aspirated 3800.<BR>Supercharged motor is in a coupe, the NOS motor is in a GT. IT has a 75 shot. So far the SC car has run a best 13.31 in cold air, and the NOS car has run a best of 13.58 in HOT air. <BR>WE will be racing one another at MAple GRove this weekend, so it will be well into the 80's I believe. It should be some interesting racing.<P>------------------<BR>Purple 1988 GT<BR>NOS injected 3800 Series II V6<BR>Best ET(75 shot)-13.58@99.08 mph<BR>w/o NOS 14.86@92.06mph||||reg||10
